# Grid B6/B7 — QFArchitecture
#
# Family: QFArchitecture (block_only_carrier.md §5.2)
# Question shape: "describe the architecture of X / how is X organised".
# Block contract requires Summary + 1+ Section (one per layer) +
# Diagram (Required=true).
#
# Ground truth: codrax read-mode pipeline has 4 stages (analyze /
# explore / extract / finalize) plus 2 conditional pre-stages
# (log_triage / perf_triage). The finalizer renders AnswerDocumentV2
# blocks (B6 default). Each stage is implemented by an Evaluator;
# the LoopController interface (commit 022add1+) is implemented by 8
# concrete Evaluator types.
#
# Positive anchor: stage names. Negative blocks unrelated frameworks.

ID="qf_architecture"
NAME="architecture — codrax read-mode pipeline 4 stages"
QUESTION="codrax 的 read-mode pipeline 由哪几个 stage 组成？每个 stage 大致负责什么？描述整体架构。"
# 2026-05-04 strictness audit: previous EC pinned the 4 stage names
# but didn't gate on per-stage role description (the question's
# "每个 stage 大致负责什么" axis). Bar = "复述 4 个名词" was too
# loose — a "the pipeline has analyze/explore/extract/finalize"
# answer PASSed without describing what each does. Strengthen by
# requiring each stage's CORE ROLE keyword to appear (analyzer
# classifies / explorer reads / extractor structures / finalizer
# renders). Allow English or Chinese phrasing.
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyze explore extract finalize"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(classif|分类|hypothes|假设)
(read_file|grep|investig|读取|调查)
(structured|symbol|结构化|提取)
(render|emit_answer_document|渲染|生成)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java .py BaseAgent.java Spring Django"
